      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.10 (down from ₹0.41 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹33.5b (up 1.9% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹524.4m (down 76% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.6% (down from 6.8% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 46% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
